# Leading slashes matter here. A bare `bin/` matches a directory called `bin` at
# ANY depth, which silently swallowed contracts/vault/src/bin/replay.rs and made
# CI fail with "can't find bin `replay`". Anchor every build-output path.
/bin/
/ts/dist/
/ts/node_modules/
/contracts/vault/target/

*.log
dump.rdb
.DS_Store
pmr-chain*.json
pmr-trace*.txt
